<title>PHILIPPINES: Equitable sets 30 ctv cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Equitable sets 30 ctv cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Banking Corp has set a 30 centavo cash dividend to be given to shareholders as of June 16, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date has been set on June 4.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8938, fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
